; the Lookout's arrival trigger (postgame.json): back from the summit with Super 13 beaten (382) and the finale unseen
; (483) Dende's scene plays by itself; its first entry picks the finale
script pg_finale_cond
    StackTestStoryFlag 382
    StackTestStoryFlagNot 483
    And
    END
end

; the Lookout's edge (zone 9 area 7): in the finale (382) the actor of the character player 1 plays does not stand: player 1 takes its spot
; (two Piccolos stood there, and a step on a sprite the player shows could find the player). In the wish scene Gohan is player 1.
script pg_stand_piccolo
    StackTestStoryFlagNot 382
    PushActiveCharIndex
    PushByte 1
    CmpNe
    Not                            ; the VM's 0x05 is a binary OR (docs/scripts.md 2.1): not the finale, or player 1 is someone else
    END
end

